        "{\"version\":1,\"content\":\"<h1>Audio \\u2192 Image</h1>\\n<p><span data-ic=\\\"workflow-v1\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"></span>&nbsp;Gemma 4 analysiert das komplette Audio und formuliert daraus einen visuellen Prompt. FLUX.2 Klein 4B erzeugt daraus ein einzelnes Kontextbild.</p>\\n<hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #777777\\\">\\n<h2>Bedienung</h2>\\n<ol><li>Unter <b>Audio laden</b> eine Datei ausw\\u00e4hlen.</li><li>Im <b>Resolution Pixaroma</b>-Node Seitenverh\\u00e4ltnis und Bildgr\\u00f6\\u00dfe festlegen.</li><li>Workflow starten. Das PNG wird unter <code>output/AudioToImage/</code> gespeichert.</li></ol>\\n<p><span data-ic=\\\"warning-v1\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"></span>&nbsp;Dieser Workflow erzeugt bewusst <b>ein Standbild</b>, kein Video und keine AudioReact-Animation.</p>\\n<hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #777777\\\">\\n<h2>Modelle</h2>\\n<h3><span data-ic=\\\"model-v4\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"></span>&nbsp;FLUX.2 Klein 4B</h3>\\n<p><span class=\\\"pix-note-btnblock\\\"><a class=\\\"pix-note-dl\\\" style=\\\"background-color: #f66744\\\" href=\\\"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-klein-4B/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/flux-2-klein-4b.safetensors\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Download flux-2-klein-4b.safetensors</a></span></p>\\n<div class=\\\"pix-note-folderhint\\\" style=\\\"color: #888888\\\">ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/FLUX</div>\\n<h3><span data-ic=\\\"CLIP\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"></span>&nbsp;Qwen3 4B f\\u00fcr FLUX.2</h3>\\n<p><span class=\\\"pix-note-btnblock\\\"><a class=\\\"pix-note-dl\\\" style=\\\"background-color: #f66744\\\" href=\\\"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-klein-4B/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_3_4b.safetensors\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Download qwen_3_4b.safetensors</a></span></p>\\n<div class=\\\"pix-note-folderhint\\\" style=\\\"color: #888888\\\">ComfyUI/models/text_encoders/Qwen</div>\\n<h3><span data-ic=\\\"CLIP\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"></span>&nbsp;Gemma 4 E4B f\\u00fcr Audio</h3>\\n<p><span class=\\\"pix-note-btnblock\\\"><a class=\\\"pix-note-dl\\\" style=\\\"background-color: #f66744\\\" href=\\\"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/gemma-4/resolve/main/text_encoders/gemma4_e4b_it_fp8_scaled.safetensors\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Download gemma4_e4b_it_fp8_scaled.safetensors</a></span></p>\\n<div class=\\\"pix-note-folderhint\\\" style=\\\"color: #888888\\\">ComfyUI/models/text_encoders/Gemma</div>\\n<h3><span data-ic=\\\"VAE\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"></span>&nbsp;FLUX.2 VAE</h3>\\n<p><span class=\\\"pix-note-btnblock\\\"><a class=\\\"pix-note-dl\\\" style=\\\"background-color: #f66744\\\" href=\\\"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-dev/resolve/main/split_files/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Download flux2-vae.safetensors</a></span></p>\\n<div class=\\\"pix-note-folderhint\\\" style=\\\"color: #888888\\\">ComfyUI/models/vae/FLUX2</div>\\n<hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #777777\\\">\\n<h2><span data-ic=\\\"nodes-installed\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"></span>&nbsp;Custom Nodes</h2>\\n<ul><li>ComfyUI-Pixaroma</li></ul>\\n<p><a class=\\\"pix-note-yt\\\" href=\\\"https://www.youtube.com/@pixaroma\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Pixaroma YouTube Channel</a>&nbsp; <a class=\\\"pix-note-discord\\\" href=\\\"https://discord.com/invite/gggpkVgBf3\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener